5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we need to decide on our destination, let's be thorough. I want to make sure we balance our budget and our comfort. What are everyone's priorities for this year's trip?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Mizuki. It is always lovely when we are all together. I think it would be wonderful to find a place where we can all relax comfortably without any stress.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want everyone to be happy! I'm curious about where we can go. Maybe we should check how we'll get there and where we will sleep?,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Minato. I think it would be helpful to understand the logistics of the journey and how the daily schedule might look. Let's make sure we don't overcomplicate the travel.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. I want us all to have a wonderful time together! To help us decide, I think it would be useful to look into the total costs and how we'll be staying.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we're all on the same page about comfort and logistics, let's divide the research. I'll start by looking into ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""How last year's days ran"" to help us plan better.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
