12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I want to know about the bathrooms and the meals! I'll look into ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements."" I hope they are nice!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will look into ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus."" I want to see if we can make the transit as seamless as possible this year.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That sounds like a great plan! To make sure we have a clear picture of the budget, I'll look into ""Valley inn rates versus urban beds"" and ""What separately booked rooms cost last time.""","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By covering logistics, costs, and the layout of our stay, we should be able to make a logical choice that suits everyone. Does anyone feel we've missed anything crucial?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I believe we have covered everything quite well, dear. It is a relief to know we are looking into so many details together. I am looking forward to seeing what we find.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'm excited to see what we find! I hope the places we look at are cozy and that everyone will feel relaxed. I'll do my best to find out about the bathrooms and meals!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we have a solid approach. By understanding the travel times and the local transport, we can ensure the journey doesn't overshadow the destination itself. I'm content with this division of tasks.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm happy with this division too. It feels like we're covering all the bases. I'll get started on my research so we can compare the costs and find the best balance for everyone!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Then it's settled. Let's each gather our information and reconvene. I'm looking forward to seeing how our findings can help us create the most balanced and enjoyable experience for everyone this year.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
